project/upload-glb-server-prep: dragging a GLB into the spoint editor (edit mode) now server-preps it. Flow: client/editor/editor.js drop handler (gated to editMode, multi-file staggered, error-toast via showToast from EditPanelDOM.js) POSTs /upload-model -> src/sdk/UploadHandler.js writes data/models/<uuid>.glb AND calls getProgressive(fp) (ProgressiveBake.js, fire-and-forget, kicks the progressive-LOD bake -> data/models/.progressive-cache/<base>-<hash>/) -> returns {url} -> client sends MSG.PLACE_MODEL(0x82){url,position} -> EditorHandlers.js spawns entity {model:url,app:placed-model,config:{collider:none}}, EDITOR_SELECTs it, broadcasts SCENE_GRAPH -> EntityLoader.js renders (progressiveReady probe: baked=ModelPool LOD, else plain-GLB) + SceneHierarchy shows a placed-model row. The /data/ static mount + StaticHandler .glb.prog/ virtual route serve both raw + baked. The legacy client-only client/FileDropLoader.js (no server prep) was DELETED + its app.js wiring removed so this is the single canonical drop path. Witnessed live end-to-end (browser-6).